---
title: "Toad Town Services - Tech Support & Audio/Video in Rhinelander and Northern Wisconsin"
description: "Toad Town Services: friendly, local tech support for homes, small businesses, nonprofits, and churches in Rhinelander and northern Wisconsin. Computers, WiFi, audio and livestreaming."
permalink: /index.html
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% from "contact-box.njk" import contactBox %}

{% block styles %}
    <style>
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #5cb85c;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #5cb85c;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        p {
            color: #f0e5d8;
        }
        .contact-info {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: rgba(73, 53, 41, 0.6);
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border: 1px solid #5cb85c;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .phone {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #5cb85c;
        }
        .services {
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .service-box {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: rgba(73, 53, 41, 0.6);
            border-left: 4px solid #5cb85c;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .service-box h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #5cb85c;
        }
        .service-box ul {
            columns: 2;
            column-gap: 30px;
            color: #f0e5d8;
        }
        .reveal-checkbox-container {
            background-color: rgba(90, 44, 44, 0.5);
            border: 2px solid #5cb85c;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .contact-details {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 2px solid #5cb85c;
        }
        .page-header {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: rgba(73, 53, 41, 0.6);
            padding: 20px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #5cb85c;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .recent-work {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: rgba(73, 53, 41, 0.6);
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border: 1px solid #5cb85c;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .recent-work h2 {
            color: #5cb85c;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .featured-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .featured-card {
            border-left: 4px solid #5cb85c;
            background-color: rgba(43, 31, 26, 0.5);
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .featured-card h3 {
            color: #5cb85c;
            font-size: 17px;
            margin: 0 0 8px;
        }
        .featured-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .recent-work img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 350px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .recent-work .date {
            color: #5cb85c;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .recent-work a {
            color: #5cb85c;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .logo {
            width: 75px;
            height: auto;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav a { margin: 0 15px; font-size: 16px; }
            .service-box ul { columns: 1; }
        }
        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a9d4a 0%, #5cb85c 100%);
            color: #faf3e8 !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="container">
    <div class="page-header">
        <h1><img class="logo" src="/images/logo/tts-logo-only-green.svg" alt="Toad Town Services Logo"> Toad Town Services</h1>
        <p><strong>Serving Rhinelander & the Northwoods of Wisconsin</strong><br>
        Technology Support for Homes, Businesses, Nonprofits & Churches</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services">
        <div class="service-box">
            <h2>💻 Computer & Phone Support</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>New computer setup & data transfer</li>
                <li>Internet & WiFi troubleshooting</li>
                <li>Switching internet, phone, or TV providers</li>
                <li>Landline replacement (Frontier copper retirement)</li>
                <li>Smartphone & tablet training</li>
                <li>Video calling setup (Zoom, FaceTime, etc.)</li>
                <li>Email setup & password recovery</li>
                <li>Software updates & maintenance</li>
                <li>Virus removal & security</li>
                <li>Photo organization & backup</li>
                <li>Online account setup (banking, shopping, etc.)</li>
                <li>Smart home device setup</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="service-box">
            <h2>🏢 Small Business Support</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Office computer & network setup</li>
                <li>Point of sale (POS) system setup</li>
                <li>Printer & scanner installation</li>
                <li>Website updates & maintenance</li>
                <li>Online presence setup (Google Business, etc.)</li>
                <li>Data backup solutions</li>
                <li>Security camera setup & troubleshooting</li>
                <li>Employee technology training</li>
                <li>Remote work setup assistance</li>
                <li>Ongoing tech support, no contract required</li>
                <li>Second opinion on IT, phone & copier contracts</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="service-box">
            <h2>🎵 Church & Event Audio/Video</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Church sound system setup & optimization</li>
                <li>Live sound mixing for services & events</li>
                <li>Microphone placement & configuration</li>
                <li>Audio equipment troubleshooting</li>
                <li>Livestream setup & troubleshooting</li>
                <li>Projection & presentation software (ProPresenter, etc.)</li>
                <li>Acoustic treatment consultation</li>
                <li>Speaker placement & calibration</li>
                <li>Audio mixing board training</li>
                <li>Event audio production</li>
                <li>Assistive listening systems</li>
                <li>Podcast & recording studio assistance</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="/rates.html" style="color: #5cb85c; font-weight: bold;">See our rates &rarr;</a></p>

    <div class="recent-work">
        <h2>Recent Projects</h2>
        <div class="featured-grid">
        {% for project in projects.projects %}{% if project.featured %}
            <div class="featured-card">
                <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
                <p>{{ project.need }}</p>
            </div>
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p><a href="/projects/">See what I did and how it turned out &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>

    {{ contactBox("Get in Touch", "Send me a message anytime for a free estimate, or call during business hours.") }}
</div>
    
{% endblock %}
